# Keep udev's automounter off mmcblk1: on R1 (EF-MX8MM) that is the carrier
# eMMC, which will hold a recovery image whose partitions carry the same labels
# as the SoM eMMC's; on the dev kit it is the SD card. Nothing in the running
# system uses them, and mounted rw under /run/media they could be written to.
/dev/mmcblk1
